 rataflow-view · 173x128 @100% · canvas 173x128 · c4-l0-final.json · 36 nodes · 29 edges · q quit
 System context: the machine manager is one box. The control plane and humans + mmctl call it; it
 drives the bare-metal providers, boots and audits the machines, which pull their boot image from
 S3, and it alerts in Slack. Nothing inside is shown yet, so L1 opens it.

    ╭─────────────╮                                                               ╭───────────────────╮
    │machine-agent│────────────────────────╮                                  ╭──▶│bare-metal machines│────────────────╮
    │             │  register + heartbeat  │                                  │   │                   │ pull boot image│
    ╰─────────────╯                        │               provider API       │   ╰───────────────────╯                │
                                           │ ╭───────────────╮  boot + audit  │                                        │
 ╭───────────────────╮    provisioning     ╰▶│               │────────────────╯  ╭────────────────────╮                │ ╭───────────────╮
 │Modal control plane│─────────────────────╮ │               │                 ╭▶│bare-metal providers│                ╰▶│S3 object store│
 │                   │                     ╰▶│Machine manager│─────────────────╯ │                    │                  │               │
 ╰───────────────────╯                       │               │                   ╰────────────────────╯                  ╰───────────────╯
                                           ╭▶│               │────────────────╮
    ╭──────────────╮         http          │ ╰───────────────╯confirm + alerts│          ╭─────╮
    │humans + mmctl│───────────────────────╯                                  ╰─────────▶│Slack│
    │              │                                                                     │     │
    ╰──────────────╯                                                                     ╰─────╯


 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 L1 · The machine manager
 L0's box opened one level: its boundary services — private gRPC, webapi, provider registry,
 cluster reconcile, SSH + BMC ops and the boot server — sit in the Machine manager box, while the
 control plane, humans, providers and machines stay outside it.


