 ║                             │     │      │  reinstall / reprovision  │ │               │     provision job     │ │                 │║
 ║╭───────────╮proposed actions│     ╰──────╯                           ╰▶│               │─────────●─────────────╯ ╰─────────────────╯║
 ║│janitor app│─────────●──────╯                                          │River job queue│                                            ║
